In article <1991Apr7.145546.440@husc3.harvard.edu> parvin1@husc9.harvard.edu (Douglas Parvin) writes:
>
>It's even tougher than that.  Wishes from demons can only be obtained on the
>first five dungeon levels.  The 20% figure applies only to level one.  The
>chance for a wish on levels two through five are progressively lower.

I hate to sound obnoxious, but...    BUZZZZZZZ!   WRONG!

It is possible to be granted a wish on levels one through nineteen.  The
exact formula for determining your change of being granted a wish by a
grateful water demon is as follows:

     chance = (20 - dungeon level) %

In other words, on level one you have a 19% chance, and it decreases by
one each level until you hit level 19, where you only have a 1% chance.
When you hit level 20, you have no chance at all.

